---
// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
// /roadmap/: where the project is, what M1 proved, what exists, what merged since, what is left, what is measured, and what comes after 1.0.
// Facts: docs/content-inventory.md sections 3.11, 9 and 10 (state as of product origin/main e129848, 2026-11-26).
// Built is not the same as usable: there is no installer, and what exists is verified on Windows only.
// GAP-01 and GAP-02 (partly closed): the recording and stills are from the M1 test run, not a designed screenshot set.
import '../../styles/area-s3.css';
import '../../styles/area-progress.css';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Section from '../../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Card from '../../components/ui/Card.astro';
import StatusChip from '../../components/ui/StatusChip.astro';
import Button from '../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import RoadmapTimeline from '../../components/roadmap/RoadmapTimeline.astro';
import RecentlyMerged from '../../components/roadmap/RecentlyMerged.astro';
import ProofStrip from '../../components/roadmap/ProofStrip.astro';
import RealEditor from '../../components/home/RealEditor.astro';
import { BUILT, NEXT_IN_P2, AFTER_1_0, AS_OF, M1_PROVED, M1_CAVEATS } from '../../data/roadmap';
import { LINKS } from '../../site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Where Cutweave is"
  description="The Cutweave roadmap: Phase 1 is done, with M1 signed off on 25 November. Phase 2 is 26 of 82 work packages in, and there is no download yet. What M1 proved, what is built, what merged, what is left, what is measured, and what comes after 1.0."
>
  <header class="hero">
    <Container>
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Roadmap</p>
        <h1>Where Cutweave is</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Phase 1 is done: M1 was signed off as go on {AS_OF.m1Label}, on Windows. Phase 2, the core editor, is {AS_OF.p2Done} of {AS_OF.p2Total} work packages in. There is still no download or installer.
        </p>
        <p class="stamp">
          <StatusChip status="in-progress" label="Pre-alpha · Phase 2 of 7" />
          <span>As of <time datetime={AS_OF.iso}>{AS_OF.label}</time>. Dates are rough and are re-estimated after each phase.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="note">
          Built is not the same as usable. In the repo you can import, cut, preview and export real video in the editor, and an agent can do the same over MCP. It runs
          from source and has only been verified on Windows. Phase 2 is what turns it into an editor you can make a whole video in.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </header>

  <Section id="phases" eyebrow="The plan" title="Eight phases to 1.0" lede="Each phase ends at a milestone with a test you can check. The marigold marker shows the phase being worked on now.">
    <RoadmapTimeline />
    <p class="plan-note">
      The plan is about 14 months to 1.0 and about 7.5 months to a Public Alpha. Human review capacity is the stated
      bottleneck.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="m1" tone="raised" eyebrow="Phase 1 is done" title="What M1 proved" lede={`The owner signed off M1 as go on ${AS_OF.m1Label}. The record is docs/milestones/M1-exit.md in the repo, and the evidence is in docs/milestones/m1-evidence.`}>
    <ul class="cards">
      {M1_PROVED.map((p) => (
        <Card as="li">
          <div><StatusChip status="built" label="Passed · Windows" /></div>
          <h3 class="card-title">{p.title}</h3>
          <p class="card-text">{p.text}</p>
        </Card>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p class="measured-line">
      <span class="measured">Measured in a work package test</span>
      <span class="foot">Informal, one dev machine. Formal runs pending.</span>
      <span class="foot">M1 gate run (WP-1O.04): one Windows 11 machine with an RTX 3080 laptop GPU, FFmpeg n8.1.3.</span>
    </p>
    <h3 class="sub">What M1 does not say</h3>
    <ul class="caveats">
      {M1_CAVEATS.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p class="plan-note">
      <a href={`${LINKS.repo}/blob/main/docs/milestones/M1-exit.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the M1 record</a>{' '}
      and its <a href={`${LINKS.repo}/tree/main/docs/milestones/m1-evidence`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">evidence folder</a>.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="real-editor" eyebrow="The real editor today" title="This is the app, not a mock-up" lede="A recording of the editor doing the M1 run, made by the test itself. The home page hero is still a labelled design preview.">
    <RealEditor idPrefix="roadmap" />
  </Section>

  <Section id="built" tone="raised" eyebrow="In the repo today" title="What exists" lede="This is code that runs in tests, mostly on one Windows machine. Each card says how far it goes, because none of it is something you can install yet.">
    <ul class="cards">
      {BUILT.map((b) => (
        <Card as="li">
          <div><StatusChip status="built" {...(b.chip ? { label: b.chip } : {})} /></div>
          <h3 class="card-title">{b.title}</h3>
          <p class="card-text">{b.text}</p>
        </Card>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section id="p2" eyebrow="Phase 2" title={`${AS_OF.p2Done} of ${AS_OF.p2Total} work packages merged`} lede={`The core editor. Counted from the merge history and docs/wbs/P2-core-editor.md, as of ${AS_OF.label}.`}>
    <div class="p2-progress">
      <progress class="bar" value={AS_OF.p2Done} max={AS_OF.p2Total} aria-label={`Phase 2 work packages merged: ${AS_OF.p2Done} of ${AS_OF.p2Total}`}>{AS_OF.p2Done} of {AS_OF.p2Total}</progress>
      <p class="p2-text"><strong>{AS_OF.p2Done} of {AS_OF.p2Total}</strong> merged, {AS_OF.p2Total - AS_OF.p2Done} to go. As of <time datetime={AS_OF.iso}>{AS_OF.label}</time>, product commit {AS_OF.head}. Decisions ADR-0023 to ADR-0032 are accepted.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section id="recent" tone="raised" eyebrow="Built since Phase 1" title="Phase 2 so far" lede={`Merged to the main branch on 25 and 26 November 2026, newest first within each area. Between the last update of this site (${AS_OF.previousHead}) and ${AS_OF.head} the main branch took ${AS_OF.commitsSince} commits and ${AS_OF.mergesSince} merges. Most of it is written by AI coding agents from public work packages, under human review. The hash links to the commit.`}>
    <RecentlyMerged set="p2" headingLevel={3} />
    <div class="earlier">
      <h3 class="sub">Closing Phase 1, 23 to 25 November</h3>
      <p class="plan-note">Real media, preview and export, then the M1 exit suite.</p>
      <RecentlyMerged set="p1-late" headingLevel={4} />
    </div>
    <details class="earlier-details">
      <summary>Phase 1 before that: 28 work packages merged on 22 and 23 November</summary>
      <p class="plan-note">As written on 23 November. Some of what these rows say was not built yet, such as real media and export, has been built since.</p>
      <RecentlyMerged set="p1-early" headingLevel={4} />
    </details>
  </Section>

  <Section id="next" eyebrow="Still to merge" title="What is left in Phase 2" lede={`${AS_OF.p2Total - AS_OF.p2Done} of ${AS_OF.p2Total} work packages. Together they make up the M2 milestone: a non-developer edits a 10-minute YouTube video and a 9:16 short, and 20 forced crashes lose no data.`}>
    <ul class="cards">
      {NEXT_IN_P2.map((n) => (
        <Card as="li">
          <div><StatusChip status="planned" label={`Planned · P2 · ${n.n} WPs`} /></div>
          <h3 class="card-title">{n.title}</h3>
          <p class="card-text">{n.text}</p>
          <p class="card-wps">{n.wps}</p>
        </Card>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p class="plan-note">
      Phase 2 work that is specified or proposed but not merged is not built. That includes on-screen edit-lock feedback, detached panels, speed, compound clips, the export queue and the keyframe graph editor.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="proof" tone="raised" eyebrow="Evidence" title="Measured so far" lede="Numbers from tests in the real code, and from the throwaway Phase 0 prototypes that tested the riskiest ideas first. Each group carries its own label.">
    <ProofStrip variant="full" headingLevel={3} />
  </Section>

  <Section id="after" eyebrow="Beyond the plan" title="After 1.0" lede="In rough order. None of this is promised for 1.0.">
    <ol class="later">
      {AFTER_1_0.map((item) => (
        <li><StatusChip status="later" /> <span>{item}</span></li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </Section>

  <Section id="follow" tone="raised" width="narrow" eyebrow="Keep up" title="How to follow along" lede="The work happens in public on GitHub. There is no newsletter, and nothing to sign up for.">
    <ul class="follow">
      <li><a href={LINKS.repo}>The repository</a>: the code and its history.</li>
      <li><a href={LINKS.issues}>Issues</a>: work packages, bugs and requests.</li>
      <li><a href={LINKS.docs}>The docs folder</a>: the product brief, architecture, roadmap and decision records.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="actions">
      <Button href={LINKS.repo} variant="primary" external icon="github">Follow on GitHub</Button>
      <Button href="/open-source/" iconEnd="arrow-right">See how to contribute</Button>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: var(--section-space) var(--space-8); background: var(--glow-marigold); }
  .hero-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--stack-md); max-width: var(--prose-max); }
  .eyebrow { font-size: var(--s3-text-xs); line-height: var(--s3-text-xs-line); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: var(--eyebrow-tracking); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--display-hero-size); line-height: var(--display-hero-line); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--text-lede-size); line-height: var(--text-lede-line); color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .stamp { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--s3-text-sm); line-height: var(--s3-text-sm-line); }
  .note { padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); border: var(--border-thin) dashed var(--border-control); border-radius: var(--radius-md); font-size: var(--s3-text-sm); line-height: var(--s3-text-sm-line); }

  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, var(--s3-card-min)), 1fr)); gap: var(--space-4); }
  .card-title { font-size: var(--display-card-size); line-height: 28px; font-weight: 650; }
  .card-text { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--s3-text-sm); line-height: var(--s3-text-sm-line); }
  .card-wps { margin-top: auto; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--s3-text-xs); line-height: var(--s3-text-xs-line); }
  .plan-note { margin-top: var(--space-6); max-width: var(--prose-max); color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--s3-text-sm); line-height: var(--s3-text-sm-line); }
  .plan-note a { color: var(--text-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: var(--space-0-5); }

  .sub { margin-top: var(--space-8); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); font-size: var(--display-card-size); line-height: 28px; font-weight: 650; }
  .caveats { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); max-width: var(--prose-max); padding-left: var(--space-6); list-style: disc; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .measured-line { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); margin-top: var(--space-6); }
  .measured { padding: 0 var(--space-2); border: var(--border-thin) dashed var(--border-control); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: var(--progress-text-xs); line-height: calc(var(--progress-text-xs-line) + var(--space-1-5)); }
  .foot { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--s3-text-sm); line-height: var(--s3-text-sm-line); }

  .p2-progress { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); max-width: var(--prose-max); }
  .bar { appearance: none; width: 100%; height: var(--progress-bar-height); border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--surface-3); overflow: hidden; }
  .bar::-webkit-progress-bar { background: var(--surface-3); }
  .bar::-webkit-progress-value { background: var(--marigold); border-radius: var(--radius-full); }
  .bar::-moz-progress-bar { background: var(--marigold); border-radius: var(--radius-full); }
  .p2-text { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--s3-text-sm); line-height: var(--s3-text-sm-line); }
  .p2-text strong { color: var(--text-primary); }

  .earlier { margin-top: var(--space-12); }
  .earlier .sub { margin-top: 0; }
  .earlier-details { margin-top: var(--space-8); }
  .earlier-details summary { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: var(--hit-touch); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .earlier-details summary:focus-visible { outline: var(--border-thick) solid var(--focus-ring); outline-offset: var(--border-thick); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }

  .later { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, var(--s3-card-min)), 1fr)); gap: var(--space-3); counter-reset: later; }
  .later li { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); border: var(--border-thin) dashed var(--border-default); border-radius: var(--radius-md); color: var(--text-secondary); }

  .follow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .follow a { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); margin-top: var(--space-6); }
</style>
